'''The Shifting Mire''' is the central bulk of the [[Swamp of Sorrows]] west of the [[Pool of Tears]]. Here you will find [[Young Sawtooth Crocolisk]]s, [[Sorrow Spinner]]s, [[Swamp Jaguar]]s and [[Draenei]].

